---
---

<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="cta-bg-glow"></div>
  <div class="cta-diagonal-accent"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-box" data-animate="scale-up">
      <div class="badge-alert" style="margin-bottom: 1.75rem;">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        <span>Atendimento Imediato para Empresas</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="cta-title">Proteja Vidas e Prepare sua Equipe Hoje Mesmo</h2>
      
      <p class="cta-desc">
        Não espere por uma fiscalização ou emergência para adequar sua empresa. Solicite agora um orçamento sem compromisso e receba uma proposta técnica sob medida em até 2 horas.
      </p>

      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <button onclick="openQuoteModal()" class="btn btn-primary btn-cta-big" id="cta-section-primary">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line></svg>
          <span>Solicitar Orçamento Corporativo</span>
        </button>

        <a 
          href="https://wa.me/5511999999999?text=Ol%C3%A1!%20Vim%20pelo%20site%20e%20preciso%20de%20um%20or%C3%A7amento%20urgente%20para%20Brigada%20de%20Inc%C3%AAndio." 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer" 
          class="btn btn-whatsapp btn-cta-big"
          id="cta-section-whatsapp"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"></path></svg>
          <span>Falar no WhatsApp</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-features">
        <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--primary-light)" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> Emissão rápida de proposta</span>
        <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--primary-light)" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> Atendimento em todo estado</span>
        <span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--primary-light)" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> Instrutores credenciados CREA/Bombeiros</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-section {
    padding: 7rem 0;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
  }

  .cta-bg-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 900px;
    height: 450px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(230, 48, 0, 0.18) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 70%);
    filter: blur(90px);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .cta-diagonal-accent {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 300px;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 50%, rgba(230, 48, 0, 0.05) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .cta-box {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4.5rem 3rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.98) 0%, rgba(12, 12, 12, 0.98) 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-fire);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.70), 0 0 40px rgba(230, 48, 0, 0.15);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .cta-desc {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem auto;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .btn-cta-big {
    padding: 1.15rem 2.2rem;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .cta-features {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  .cta-features span {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .cta-box {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }
    .cta-buttons {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .btn-cta-big {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .cta-features {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
